 HISTORY                                                          8248 1451
 -------                                                          8248 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8248 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic          8248 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed    8248 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law      8248 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to produce 8248 1451
 File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=15 and      8248 1451
 ZA=115 were used for U in UO2 (HALEU - 19.75% enrichment).       8248 1451
